      "message": "Could we standardize the new plugin on `ipfix` throughout instead of retaining the overlapping `ipfix-export`, `flow_report`, and `vnet_flow` names? This would include `src/plugins/ipfix/`, `add_vpp_plugin(ipfix)`, matching source names such as `ipfix.c`, `ipfix_api.c`, and `ipfix_classify.c`, and consistent `ipfix_*` symbols and types—including lookup strings, include guards, call sites, API/documentation names, and tests.",
      "revId": "bbc8ec90ef34db45d34264d935cf5602fc91d3e5",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
